-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 258  Maps 750 / 751 -- the 32 Cata spells SmartAI needs to stop discarding rows
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- SmartAIMgr validates every cast row against sSpellMgr at load and, when the
-- spell is unknown, SKIPS THE WHOLE ROW. The 2026-08-06 Errors.log sweep found
-- 35 such rows across 27 templates on maps 750 and 751 with roughly 600 live
-- spawns between them -- every one a silently missing ability. Three templates
-- lost EVERY row this way and therefore also logged "has SmartAI enabled but no
-- SmartAI entries": 3601824 Plague Lurker (39 spawns), 3604472 Haunting Vision
-- (12) and 3636976 Ticker.
--
-- All 32 ids are absent from BOTH the deployed server Spell.dbc (53,156
-- records) and `spell_dbc`. Those are two different places and `spell_dbc`
-- holds ONLY custom additions -- "missing from spell_dbc" is not the same as
-- "missing", and checking just one of the two has produced false findings here
-- before. All 32 resolve in the real Cata 4.3.4 Spell.dbc.
--
-- Generated by tools/gen_hyjal_spell_downport_r25.py from the untouched 4.3.4
-- client (wow-update-base-15601.MPQ + enUS/locale-enUS.MPQ). Do not hand-edit
-- the INSERT: re-run the generator. Three transforms are applied and each one
-- is load-bearing --
--
--   * SUMMON EffectMiscValue -> the +3,600,000 clone, for the four Cata-only
--     summons created in section 2 below. 12898 "Phantim Illusion" is
--     deliberately NOT remapped: it is a stock vanilla creature that already
--     exists raw on our side, so 20671 keeps pointing at it.
--   * SUMMON EffectMiscValueB is a SummonProperties.dbc id and Cata rows 2929 /
--     2974 do not exist in 3.3.5 (204 records). Substituted with the live rows
--     that are structurally identical on (Control, Faction, Title, Slot) --
--     2929 -> 64 (wild), 2974 -> 61 (guardian) -- rather than fabricating DBC
--     rows with guessed flags. Same discipline as the VehicleSeat substitution
--     in MoltenFront/10_.
--   * Cata effect 165 -> 2 SCHOOL_DAMAGE, for 'Shoot' 69373 and 'Lob Fire'
--     69375. Of the three Cata spells that use effect 165 at index 0 and also
--     exist in our Spell.dbc, two carry Effect_1 = 2. Leaving it at 165 is not
--     an option -- an effect id >= 165 asserts and segfaults the worldserver at
--     boot -- and the generator's fallback zeroes it, leaving both spells inert.
--
-- No spell in this set is a "Generic Quest Invisibility". Every Cata name was
-- read before the list was frozen; keep doing that, because porting one of
-- those onto a clone hides the NPC from every player and logs nothing at all.
--
-- CLIENT SIDE. The matching 32 rows are appended to Custom/CSV DBC/Spell.csv;
-- that file still needs recompiling and packing into BOTH patch-4 and
-- enGB/patch-enGB-3 (enGB outranks patch-N), plus a refresh of the server's own
-- data/dbc copy. Until that lands the server knows the spells and the client
-- does not.

-- ---- 1. the 32 spells ------------------------------------------------------

DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (85713,85826,83701,81193,85873,78827,90789,79964,79902,79901,77522,77471,77806,20671,69375,69373,74723,79823,78907,79825,74737,75072,74811,77160,76963,77508,77627,66060,77209,97426,85716,74729);

